      "text": "when Jesus was born in Bethlehem, Matt. 2:1. Among them that are born of women there hath not risen a greater, Matt. 11:11 (Luke 7:28). that man if he had not been born, Matt. 26:24 (Mark 14:21). unto you is born this day … a Saviour, Luke 2:11. Which were born, not of blood … but of God, John 1:13. Except a man be born again, John 3:3 (3:7). as of one born out of due time, 1 Cor. 15:8. born after the flesh … born after the Spirit, Gal. 4:29. Being born again, not of corruptible seed, 1 Pet. 1:23. doeth righteousness is born of him, 1 Jn. 2:29. is born of God doth not commit sin, 1 Jn. 3:9 (5:18). every one that loveth is born of God, 1 Jn. 4:7. believeth that Jesus is the Christ is born of God, 1 Jn. 5:1. whatsoever is born of God overcometh the world, 1 Jn. 5:4.",
